{
  "request": "We're a city parks and recreation department in the US. I need a special event permit application for events in our parks: anything with 50 or more people, amplified sound, tents or stages, vendors, alcohol or a street closure. Ask for the organizer, a day-of contact, event details with setup and cleanup times, expected attendance, a site plan, sound, food and alcohol, restrooms and trash, security and first aid, and a certificate of insurance naming the city as additional insured. Applications are due at least 30 days before the event.",
  "title": "Special event permit application",
  "description": "Use when someone applies to hold a special event in a city park: the organizer, the event and its times, the site and equipment, food and alcohol, safety and services, insurance and the organizer's agreement.",
  "maxPages": 4,
  "content": {
    "schemaVersion": 3,
    "branding": {
      "organizationName": "",
      "logoAsset": null,
      "logoDataUrl": null,
      "logoAlignment": "left",
      "logoWidthPercent": 24,
      "primaryColor": "#14532d",
      "accentColor": "#15803d"
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "0a160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Special event permit application",
        "level": 1,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0a160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Apply for a special event permit if your event in a city park will have any of the following:",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0a160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
        "type": "bullet_list",
        "items": [
          "50 or more people at any one time",
          "amplified sound",
          "tents, canopies, stages or other temporary structures",
          "food, drink or merchandise sold or given away by vendors",
          "alcohol",
          "a street or parking area closed for the event"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "0a160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "When to apply: send your completed application at least 30 days before the event. We cannot review an application until every section is complete and the site plan is attached. Permit and park fees are listed in the department's current fee schedule, and are due when the permit is issued.",
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "When to apply:",
            "bold": true
          },
          {
            "text": " send your completed application at least 30 days before the event. We cannot review an application until every section is complete and the site plan is attached. Permit and park fees are listed in the department's current fee schedule, and are due when the permit is issued."
          }
        ],
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0a160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "How we use your information: the department uses this information to review your application, to coordinate with police, fire and other city departments, and to contact you about your event. Permit applications may be public records, but we do not publish personal phone numbers or email addresses.",
        "runs": [
          {
            "text": "How we use your information:",
            "bold": true
          },
