        "text": "I confirm that the information in this application is true. If the permit is issued, I agree to follow its conditions and the park rules, to have the permit with me at the event, and to leave the site as I found it. I understand that the organizer is responsible for any damage to park property during the event, and that the city may change or cancel the permit for public safety.",
